  "referenceNumber": "INU0411",
  "remarks": "\nThe Ministry of Energy (MOE) of Iran is an involved person under the Iran (Sanctions) (Nuclear) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 because: MOE, as a Ministry of the Government of Iran, facilitates a relevant nuclear activity, namely the proliferation or development of nuclear weapons in, or for use in, Iran; an activity that could lead to the development of nuclear weapons in, or for use in, Iran; and the development of a nuclear weapon delivery system in, or for use in, Iran.\n",
